  <h3>Example 12: A Straight Aircraft Flight Segment</h3>
  <p>For a simplified flight segment, an aircraft travels 5 km along a straight path while gaining 1.5 km in altitude. The path is the hypotenuse, <span set:html={rich('[[c=5\\,\\text{km}]]')} />, and the vertical gain is the opposite side, <span set:html={rich('[[a=1.5\\,\\text{km}]]')} />:</p>
  <p><span set:html={rich('[[\\sin(A)=\\frac{1.5}{5}]]')} /></p>
